{"slug":"n-b-a","ar":"ن ب ء","total":160,"core":"news; informing; prophethood","forms":[{"ar":"نَّبِىّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":75,"gloss":"The Prophet","word":"an-nabi","ex":{"s":37,"a":112,"p":3,"ar":["وَبَشَّرْنَـٰهُ","بِإِسْحَـٰقَ","نَبِيًّا","مِّنَ","ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ"],"en":"And We gave him good tidings of Isaac, a prophet from among the righteous"}},{"ar":"نَبَّأَ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":46,"gloss":"to inform, tell","word":null,"ex":{"s":15,"a":51,"p":1,"ar":["وَنَبِّئْهُمْ","عَن","ضَيْفِ","إِبْرَٰهِيمَ"],"en":"And inform them about the guests of Abraham"}},{"ar":"نَبَأ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":29,"gloss":"news, tidings","word":null,"ex":{"s":78,"a":2,"p":2,"ar":["عَنِ","ٱلنَّبَإِ","ٱلْعَظِيمِ"],"en":"About the great news"}},{"ar":"نُّبُوَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"prophethood","word":null,"ex":{"s":45,"a":16,"p":7,"ar":["وَلَقَدْ","ءَاتَيْنَا","بَنِىٓ","إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","وَٱلْحُكْمَ","وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ","وَرَزَقْنَـٰهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","وَفَضَّلْنَـٰهُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ"],"en":"And We did certainly give the Children of Israel the Scripture and judgement and prophethood, and We provided them with good things and preferred them over the worlds"}},{"ar":"أَنۢبَأَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":4,"gloss":"to inform","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":31,"p":10,"ar":["وَعَلَّمَ","ءَادَمَ","ٱلْأَسْمَآءَ","كُلَّهَا","ثُمَّ","عَرَضَهُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","فَقَالَ","أَنۢبِـُٔونِى","بِأَسْمَآءِ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَـٰدِقِينَ"],"en":"And He taught Adam the names - all of them. Then He showed them to the angels and said, \"Inform Me of the names of these, if you are truthful"}},{"ar":"يَسْتَنۢبِـُٔ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"to ask to be informed","word":null,"ex":{"s":10,"a":53,"p":1,"ar":["وَيَسْتَنۢبِـُٔونَكَ","أَحَقٌّ","هُوَ ۖ","قُلْ","إِى","وَرَبِّىٓ","إِنَّهُۥ","لَحَقٌّ ۖ","وَمَآ","أَنتُم","بِمُعْجِزِينَ"],"en":"And they ask information of you, [O Muhammad], \"Is it true?\" Say, \"Yes, by my Lord. Indeed, it is truth; and you will not cause failure [to Allah]"}}],"surahs":[[33,18],[3,14],[2,11],[6,10],[9,9],[5,8],[19,8],[66,8],[7,5],[12,5],[8,4],[10,4],[4,3],[11,3],[18,3],[26,3],[38,3],[15,2],[22,2],[28,2],[29,2],[31,2],[39,2],[43,2],[49,2],[54,2],[58,2],[64,2],[13,1],[14,1],[17,1],[20,1],[24,1],[25,1],[27,1],[34,1],[35,1],[37,1],[41,1],[45,1],[53,1],[57,1],[60,1],[62,1],[65,1],[75,1],[78,1]]}